    <h2>Why Choose a Credit Card through RupeeXpert?</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Wide Selection:</strong> With over 35 credit card options, you can find a card that perfectly matches your lifestyle and needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Best Offers:</strong> We provide exclusive offers and deals to help you get the most out of your credit card.</li>
        <li><strong>Tailored Recommendations:</strong> Our advanced technology helps you compare different cards and find the one that suits you best.</li>
        <li><strong>Easy Application Process:</strong> Apply for your chosen credit card through our user-friendly platform in just a few steps.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure and Reliable:</strong> Your personal information is safe with us. We use top-notch security measures to protect your data.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="benefits" class="container">
    <h2>Benefits of Our Credit Cards</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Rewards and Cashback:</strong>Earn points, miles, or cashback on every purchase, redeemable for exciting rewards like travel, merchandise, or statement credits.</li>
        <li><strong>Travel Perks:</strong> Enjoy benefits such as free airport lounge access, travel insurance, and air miles that can be used for flights and hotel stays.</li>
        <li><strong>Low-Interest Rates:</strong> Save money with low APR rates, making it easier to manage your balance and pay off your debt.</li>
        <li><strong>Exclusive Offers:</strong> Access special discounts and promotions on dining, shopping, entertainment, and more.</li>
        <li><strong>24/7 Customer Support:</strong> Get round-the-clock assistance for any queries or issues related to your credit card.</li>
        <li><strong>Fraud Protection:</strong> Stay protected with advanced security features that monitor and prevent unauthorized transactions.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="types" class="container">
    <h2>Types of Credit Cards We Offer</h2>
    <div class="card-types">
        <div class="card-type">
            <h3>Rewards Credit Cards</h3>
            <p>Earn points, miles, or cashback on every purchase and redeem them for exciting rewards.</p>
        </div>
